slider23:20<0,100,0.1>-Mallet noise (%)
slider24:50<0,100,0.1>-Vowel (U O A E I)
slider25:35<5,100,0.1>-Voices length (%)
slider26:50<0,100,0.1>-Voices spread (%)
slider27:50<0,100,0.1>-Blend (brass .. strings, %)
slider28:50<0,100,0.1>-Swell (%)
slider29:70<5,100,0.1>-Strings length (%)
slider30:0<0,100,0.1>-Pad level (%)
slider31:45<0,100,0.1>-Pad tone (%)
slider32:0<0,3,1{1/16,1/16T,1/32,1/8T}>-Pulse division
slider33:70<0,100,0.1>-Pulse depth (%)
slider34:30<0,100,0.1>-Pulse shape (gate .. swell, %)
slider35:0<0,50,1>-Pulse swing (%)
